    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379960/extras/fff894afab2a1be1b089439141797ed8.avif?t=1687199698\" /></span><br><br>Ruins of the Lost is a roguelike game set in the remnants of an ancient civilization. As a spirit warrior, you'll face off against a variety of evil minions while exploring the mysterious environment. Discover and use unique bows to adapt your combat style as you confront increasingly challenging enemies.<br>Experience bullet hell elements that test your reflexes and strategic thinking. Throughout your journey, you'll come across multiple shops run by shopkeeper spirits who offer various items and bows to assist you in your battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379960/extras/b585f624e7186abed2b9086ebf357ec8.avif?t=1687199698\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379960/extras/7dca7cb6de1d8759223dadfb369c12de.poster.avif?t=1687199698\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379960/extras/7dca7cb6de1d8759223dadfb369c12de.webm?t=1687199698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379960/extras/7dca7cb6de1d8759223dadfb369c12de.mp4?t=1687199698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379960/extras/4eda11b392715bfbd47ee6a4cb405b33.avif?t=1687199698\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379960/extras/39710d8b9cb001059bc2bf31f45f